{
  "$comment": "BINDER corporate colors. Hex applies to screen, CMYK to print. Grays print as pure K, chosen with the Coated FOGRA39 press profile so the printed gray has the lightness of the screen value where black ink can reach it; from Gray 600 down the print ramp runs in even steps that stay distinguishable from black.",
  "version": "2026",
  "scaleNote": "Nine grays numbered 100 (lightest) to 900 (darkest), the same direction as CSS font-weight, each with a name for talking to people. White and Black carry no number: they sit outside the ramp, as $white and $black do in Bootstrap and Tailwind.",
